sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Person as Browser user
    participant API as Correct host API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Person->>API: Request private data with session cookie
    API->>DB: Check session hash, expiry, and current account role
    DB-->>API: Matching account or no valid session
    alt Session missing, expired, or wrong for this portal
        API-->>Person: Reject access
    else Valid session for this portal
        API->>API: Enforce workspace role, ownership, and clinic approval
        alt Additional checks fail
            API-->>Person: Deny the protected operation
        else Checks pass
            API->>DB: Read only the permitted records
            DB-->>API: Account-scoped information
            API-->>Person: Return authorized data
        end
    end
